<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Goodman tops turnover on big trade.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Goodman tops turnover on big trade.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food group Goodman Fielder Ltd topped the turnover in morning trade on the Australian Stock Exchange after a parcel of 13.2 million or 1.1 percent of its shares was traded.</p>
<p>The parcel was traded by Macquarie Equities just before 11.00 a.m. (0000 GMT) at A$1.55 per share.</p>
<p>Goodman Fielder, which has periodically been the subject of takeover speculation, was up one cent at A$1.58 at 11.20 a.m. (0020 GMT) after the trade.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
